    "plan": "The plan is to create two distinct Reddit posts discussing the hypothetical scenario of local LLM privacy improvements. Both posts will adhere to the specified constraints: technical English, restrained titles, specific word counts, and explicit mention of the hypothetical nature of the experiment. The first post will focus on the concept of prompt isolation as a key piece of evidence. The second post will broaden the scope to include log analysis and network traffic as additional verification points. Both will clearly state the lack of formal audits and invite focused discussion."
